 "stop": "3 quatrains",
 "poem": "The current world with wonder\nBasks in the reflected light.\nWe have its hues and colors, so\nTo see each thing unseen\nShines on a lustrous gilded mirror,\nAnd those who never saw it seeing.\nWe behold the golden suns above\nWhich throned in the blue atmosphere, see\nOn the sea-splendour glittering\nThe silver stars somewhere;\nOur spheres are filled with light divine,\nWherein our universe",
